    {
      "id": "2814ae1e-fb9a-48db-aeba-cf946c4d72da",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe que proyeccion enquadra horario, sala, recepcao do publico e clima geral da exibicao.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "91aab354-ef4d-48e7-90ff-9501f6008a81",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>la proyección</strong> olha para a exibicao inteira: a sessao, o ato de passar o filme para um publico.</p><p>Ela aparece bem em comentarios sobre horario, sala, recepcao do publico ou clima geral da experiencia.</p><p>Se voce quer lembrar o evento completo antes de entrar em detalhes, comece por <strong>la proyección</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7c1cae81977340e7b653359e1182615c_b02-la-proyeccion-de-anoche-termino-con-un-aplauso-larguisimo.mp3?Expires=1794099859&Signature=04dzgCn~wcn~6-Iz2RtpqfTjT8r702o30cLNzjR7wqM9rIBVnnJga4uQOs5IkBwE0ZTCMsthN833Uc6FGAlOA5NZlU64RnY~AnIu7h463BrAls6beo39GNLGIxXjjEIcJKWjFr-Wf4zX0Tpq-PNVcWUTJ5ThfXH5VV9lOH5aYRz3-40HyS332DMlIyatADBOcPzrBfnb9s95O3b6Rmc4Fqlw1GQm-VI11jakrTVvhZOABCSjIueCBSD9WfkxTuZLw7rS8gHyPKk9CV806nBzdgrKdBee8IsAzVthni313mf9FA8d31Xm51DNfViRRKehiUN8TJEOX-CdyNLa~X-KoQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b7e20c24-3276-4d9f-a167-626a34116e54",
      "title": "Observe a imagem, escute a frase e associe escena a um ponto preciso dentro do filme.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f8366a00-a0e0-4574-a40b-08ab7b6bdac4",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a lembranca recorta um ponto preciso do filme.</p><p><strong>La escena del pasillo cambió por completo mi lectura del personaje.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>A cena do corredor mudou por completo minha leitura da personagem.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a0714955055244bab92bc90e10b3fb8f_b04-escena-del-pasillo.png?Expires=1794099859&Signature=tFQOIQvHJA6vTVOnNiagKwe7dv5hG-V37CfL3TFvzn9aapQxg~75TQAV9pgiSYX-SdqCOwe5cfMuYwmHARYNggjA0pZ1Z8tVydEbuiyFESgZgsBhQ~xr8o81S05GvQnT423mp86YsJqtXXm-9EEE2G3Rpc9feHygktk6hjKwAFBbMacRgJ~GaGf3Z9jOL1H3g~HOaIYqAOaUvyOZGVg4MHiOy5cPhomjJgolgzdlDtvI38wqXpMMP2N98Rki~oabLdGBM4dsasmehnFo~otb0xl7exd8VlNIEIhXQhvy2jMsI4CIFbmsx3xpCarofL3CQss7zABV75yG7wPTGkLtJQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e960efc5abe94725b50bdcc83b6fdc0f_b04-la-escena-del-pasillo-cambio-por-completo-mi-lectura-del-personaje.mp3?Expires=1794099859&Signature=gpq35tClSB7zKEzFeclqD9c0zNpDbYnHb0Q1o5VFEJDZ~vHjY5MYJY-Amqv-wP8PKZYz93WJJol7HcKwpC5ZFegmaC6ncU-dZ0rEUCp~XEqScJjl23iR6zKc8rFywCXlhAaVG7TzI5N-y3GqLwhr9L9RnmeZ0QCM2fkzXdCQv~FjKACV-QWBVO8tnHIgBfj3oGILonoVdN8nYpsSBIY-Z5-o3WOd4pGB~jPQk7yF2yXvLXkQ49GIRZJggNXBo5UMESxxcp~xEPpnwl6QvVf7XpO~dBVIZmvaQM3yF3jp4-887ciL58CzAKQ0-9xM73lMH2VSyPmb1B9Wu4TL~B7Esg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
