    {
      "id": "347596ef-61d3-4867-bcdf-28246e0144cf",
      "title": "Leia a explicacao e observe como escena ajuda a isolar um gesto, uma fala ou uma virada bem localizada.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5ea16062-0fc3-421d-a8ac-b3dd1cb8f1db",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>la escena</strong> recorta um momento concreto dentro do filme.</p><p>Normalmente voce usa a palavra quando quer isolar um gesto, uma fala, um encontro ou uma virada muito localizada.</p><p>Ela ajuda a tirar do todo exatamente o pedaco que fez voce mudar de leitura.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e960efc5abe94725b50bdcc83b6fdc0f_b04-la-escena-del-pasillo-cambio-por-completo-mi-lectura-del-personaje.mp3?Expires=1794099859&Signature=gpq35tClSB7zKEzFeclqD9c0zNpDbYnHb0Q1o5VFEJDZ~vHjY5MYJY-Amqv-wP8PKZYz93WJJol7HcKwpC5ZFegmaC6ncU-dZ0rEUCp~XEqScJjl23iR6zKc8rFywCXlhAaVG7TzI5N-y3GqLwhr9L9RnmeZ0QCM2fkzXdCQv~FjKACV-QWBVO8tnHIgBfj3oGILonoVdN8nYpsSBIY-Z5-o3WOd4pGB~jPQk7yF2yXvLXkQ49GIRZJggNXBo5UMESxxcp~xEPpnwl6QvVf7XpO~dBVIZmvaQM3yF3jp4-887ciL58CzAKQ0-9xM73lMH2VSyPmb1B9Wu4TL~B7Esg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1ce65540-f1fd-4f07-8fad-df06b023f7df",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e associe secuencia a varios movimentos ligados pela mesma progressao.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5eea571e-2922-4c8b-bbd4-a3e5599a5624",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a lembranca olha para um trecho mais amplo.</p><p><strong>La secuencia inicial parece tranquila, pero ya anuncia el conflicto.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>A sequencia inicial parece tranquila, mas ja anuncia o conflito.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/09fd9bfbd6334facba9e6c415afeb105_b06-secuencia-inicial-monitor.png?Expires=1794099859&Signature=Ol3j7UFdOC4qoxTp6SLQsskIF0OdXfoeC-aMeHJhqC-GKvHHDpc2yEjTmwInemE0SjAuDbNRaeAk4tXyerXF8twaxzitt5mFyzgzmmXqPKwgKAlLxqQ5X7HtosWYKZETFJGVY6sGFJt8Y8Bix-Sx0SHrVEX5fMcFVwYx~iFs6iOqh6FzHkGsOiz~xXd-yKA430nzqZ48RJ~8uKTOYi5rJ0KMnrxYTbmG8v1RSAVwYS5~u1DCKXn1jWJURYiEiLO0UYCQHzZLs9FS4Je4wW5uj3CXO0t75KidSnRBS6eNjkQLQCE23u-FVLcJnUwl4tcaCOZiscoMUZ7xq9bm0MxonA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/23f22a1039164d48a77295bd96140a02_b06-la-secuencia-inicial-parece-tranquila-pero-ya-anuncia-el-conflicto.mp3?Expires=1794099859&Signature=L5L0ChQaXdQ0olPbdic0ADhwQ35ZEIa1rJvuLCYfqVA0ZbPj-PWKmO0re42nmlCXKvm3GxYPgFShxQlgNi1X4H3K5OW8NwdQW8bqBJycvHFzUNT6YuwS9ocO3HhEH7xzQ30xIlX2-K5HkzmmOMQ3O3Uhr2lITpdJ5xzE4-lpIBqTabDUpw6MmGxc4gQdiIBiMORkdMiVBZWXIz8vcHWjSsuqu2EJXD2SH6uK3~GlNQhDm27KegO4R9uEHITm3AQapReW56akU7EqFkvPM~EJ5vJnhqMgIivrOUdd~A58nDXXhu1u4pK9v5IsaLpZeiFhE0VlN7RZ9mRS6rEhsggfkQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
